{"id":"n40105-1-8","stage":1,"title":"노래방 · 练歌房","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40105-1-8-1","ko":"노래방에 가지 않을래?","zh":"要去唱K吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노래방에","meaning":"练歌房，练歌厅","explanation":"노래방：练歌房，练歌厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"노래방","audio":"/audio/81119c5e77351e6b0f3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40105","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래방에","audio":"/audio/7f278d496a4be2b5bc4c.mp3"}},{"text":"가지","meaning":"去，前往","explanation":"가다：去，前往；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"3","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지","audio":"/audio/b16bec1ce2b9561977e6.mp3"}},{"text":"않을래?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않을래","audio":"/audio/97b59f36ceff553040f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"81119c5e77351e6b","term":"노래방","zh":"练歌房，练歌厅","audio":"/audio/81119c5e77351e6b0f3e.mp3","entryId":"40105","definition":"设有可以看着歌词唱歌的音响设施的场所。","pronunciation":["노래방"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，前往","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为参加某种聚会而移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/dae4b4cbf7e4965e7dbc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40105-1-8-2","ko":"나 목이 좀 안 좋아서 노래를 못 할 것 같아.","zh":"我嗓子有点不舒服，好像唱不了歌了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"so